                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Clear Growth Metrics:</b> Define measurable indicators that show whether growth initiatives are successful.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Strong Product Value:</b> Ensure customers clearly understand and experience the value provided by the product.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Experimentation:</b> Test assumptions before making large-scale product or growth investments.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Cross-Functional Collaboration:</b> Align product, engineering, marketing, sales, and customer teams around common growth objectives.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Continuous Optimization:</b> Regularly evaluate results and improve growth initiatives based on evidence.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

